---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Property Sales"
  description="A map-first property sales web application with interactive parcel mapping, live availability, and search by location, size, and price. Built by Simon Maps."
  path="/property-sales"
  eyebrow="Geospatial web application"
>
  <p class="lede">Visual, map-first property discovery instead of spreadsheets.</p>

  <h2>What it does</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Interactive parcel mapping with live availability status</li>
    <li>Search by location, size, and price across listed properties</li>
    <li>Built for land sellers who want buyers to explore plots on a map</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="actions">
    <a href="/demos/properties/" class="btn btn-solid">View live demo</a>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn">Get one for your listings</a>
  </div>
</Page>
